<title>HONG KONG: Shanghai International renamed Shenyin Wanguo HK.</title>
<headline>Shanghai International renamed Shenyin Wanguo HK.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai International (H.K.) Ltd said it had changed its name to Shenyin Wanguo (H.K.) Ltd with effect from November 19.</p>
<p>The company is involved in property investment and share custodian and financial services.</p>
<p>In August, Shenyin Wanguo (H.K.) appointed Jiang Guo Fang, vice-president of Shenyin &amp; Wanguo Securities Co Ltd, as the chairman of the company, replacing Gao Guofu.</p>
<p>Shenyin &amp; Wanguo Securities is the indirect controlling shareholder of Shenyin Wanguo (H.K.).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
